  "extractionNotes": "Stillbirth at 37 weeks on 2026-04-12 (third pregnancy, second delivery) evidenced by a generic doctor's certificate stating the stillbirth, not the dedicated stillbirth certificate form and no registry act; ZUS accepted it. 8-week maternity leave requested from the employer; the Z-3 states the benefit period 2026-04-12..2026-06-06 and the ZUS benefit screen shows the same period; a typed note says maternity benefit was granted. Rate not printed (100% inferred). The Z-3 salary table runs 2024-11..2025-10: every month up to 2025-08 fully on maternity benefit for an earlier child (last day 2025-09-01), then two worked months at 4600.00; the contractual amount in the benefit months is about 4500.00 (two rows could also read 4600.00; those months have no days worked and do not count). The earlier benefit is recorded from the first table month only; its real start and leave types are not in the file. The table does not reach the months just before the event (2025-11..2026-03 missing); not shifted. Title start 2020-01-02 on the Z-3, 2020-01-05 in the register. Payer size box not legible. asOf = verification date on the ZUS screen (partly legible)."
